resources.string:
Create a daily menu based on the following food preferences: %1$s.

Consider the following user information to personalize the menu:
- Locale: %2$s
- Age: %3$d
- Weight: %4$d kg
- Height: %5$d cm

Organize the menu as follows, allowing each meal to have more than one dish (optional and based on your judgment). For lunch and dinner, include an optional dessert (also optional):

{
 "title": "Title of the menu based on the chosen dishes and preferences (Do not mention the date or user information)",
 "date": "%6$s (Parseable to LocalDateTime in Kotlin)",
 "breakfast": {
 "meals": [
 {
 "description": "Description of breakfast dish 1",
 "ingredients": ["Ingredient 1", "Ingredient 2"],
 "instructions": "Instructions to prepare breakfast dish 1"
 },
 {
 "description": "Description of breakfast dish 2",
 "ingredients": ["Ingredient 1", "Ingredient 2"],
 "instructions": "Instructions to prepare breakfast dish 2"
 }
 ]
 },
 "lunch": {
 "meals": [
 {
 "description": "Description of lunch dish 1",
 "ingredients": ["Ingredient 1", "Ingredient 2"],
 "instructions": "Instructions to prepare lunch dish 1"
 },
 {
 "description": "Description of lunch dish 2",
 "ingredients": ["Ingredient 1", "Ingredient 2"],
 "instructions": "Instructions to prepare lunch dish 2"
 },
 {
 "description": "Description of lunch dessert",
 "ingredients": ["Ingredient 1", "Ingredient 2"],
 "instructions": "Instructions to prepare lunch dessert"
 }
 ]
 },
 "snack": {
 "meals": [
 {
 "description": "Description of the snack",
 "ingredients": ["Ingredient 1", "Ingredient 2"],
 "instructions": "Instructions to prepare the snack"
 }
 ]
 },
 "dinner": {
 "meals": [
 {
 "description": "Description of dinner dish 1",
 "ingredients": ["Ingredient 1", "Ingredient 2"],
 "instructions": "Instructions to prepare dinner dish 1"
 },
 {
 "description": "Description of dinner dish 2",
 "ingredients": ["Ingredient 1", "Ingredient 2"],
 "instructions": "Instructions to prepare dinner dish 2"
 },
 {
 "description": "Description of dinner dessert",
 "ingredients": ["Ingredient 1", "Ingredient 2"],
 "instructions": "Instructions to prepare dinner dessert"
 }
 ]
 }
}

Create a daily exercise routine based on the following food preferences: %1$s.

Consider the following user information to personalize the routine:
- Locale: %2$s
- Age: %3$d
- Weight: %4$d kg
- Height: %5$d cm

Organize the routine as follows, ensuring to include at least 5 exercises in the main exercises section (`mainExercises`). For each exercise, provide complete details according to the structure indicated:

{
 "title": "Title of the routine based on the chosen exercises (Do not mention the date or user information)",
 "date": "%6$s (Parseable to LocalDateTime in Kotlin)",
 "warmUp": {
 "exercises": [
 {
 "description": "Description of warm-up exercise 1",
 "objectives": ["Objective 1", "Objective 2"],
 "equipment": ["Equipment 1", "Equipment 2"],
 "instructions": ["Step 1", "Step 2"]
 },
 {
 "description": "Description of warm-up exercise 2",
 "objectives": ["Objective 1", "Objective 2"],
 "equipment": ["Equipment 1", "Equipment 2"],
 "instructions": ["Step 1", "Step 2"]
 }
 ]
 },
 "mainExercises": {
 "exercises": [
 {
 "description": "Description of main exercise 1",
 "objectives": ["Objective 1", "Objective 2"],
 "equipment": ["Equipment 1", "Equipment 2"],
 "instructions": ["Step 1", "Step 2"]
 },
 {
 "description": "Description of main exercise 2",
 "objectives": ["Objective 1", "Objective 2"],
 "equipment": ["Equipment 1", "Equipment 2"],
 "instructions": ["Step 1", "Step 2"]
 },
 {
 "description": "Description of main exercise 3",
 "objectives": ["Objective 1", "Objective 2"],
 "equipment": ["Equipment 1", "Equipment 2"],
 "instructions": ["Step 1", "Step 2"]
 },
 {
 "description": "Description of main exercise 4",
 "objectives": ["Objective 1", "Objective 2"],
 "equipment": ["Equipment 1", "Equipment 2"],
 "instructions": ["Step 1", "Step 2"]
 },
 {
 "description": "Description of main exercise 5",
 "objectives": ["Objective 1", "Objective 2"],
 "equipment": ["Equipment 1", "Equipment 2"],
 "instructions": ["Step 1", "Step 2"]
 }
 ]
 },
 "coolDown": {
 "exercises": [
 {
 "description": "Description of cool-down exercise 1",
 "objectives": ["Objective 1", "Objective 2"],
 "equipment": ["Equipment 1", "Equipment 2"],
 "instructions": ["Step 1", "Step 2"]
 },
 {
 "description": "Description of cool-down exercise 2",
 "objectives": ["Objective 1", "Objective 2"],
 "equipment": ["Equipment 1", "Equipment 2"],
 "instructions": ["Step 1", "Step 2"]
 }
 ]
 },
 "aditionalInfo": "Any additional relevant information for the routine"
}
